            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The advent of cyclooxygenase-2 inhibitors has been both a blessing and a curse for pain management. An in-depth understanding of the biological molecules in the arachidonic acid metabolism may alleviate pain without risk.</AbstractText>
